  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce cauliflower (florets)",
    "1/4 cup olive oil",
    "1/2 cup tahini",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (chopped)",
    "2 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "1 teaspoon salt (or to taste)",
    "1/4 teaspoon paprika",
    "3 tablespoon water (as needed for texture)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Pre-heat oven to 425F and prep ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-hummus/#wprm-recipe-53389-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Keto-roasted-cauliflower-hummus-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a non-stick baking sheet lightly, then toss cauliflower in half of the olive oil. Spread the cauliflower into a single layer so that each piece of cauliflower is touching the baking sheet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-hummus/#wprm-recipe-53389-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Keto-roasted-cauliflower-hummus-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast the cauliflower for 30-40 minutes or until browned and softened through.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-hummus/#wprm-recipe-53389-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Keto-roasted-cauliflower-hummus-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a blender or food processor, add the tahini, remaining olive oil, garlic, lemon juice, salt, paprika, roasted cauliflower, and 2 tablespoons of water. Blend the mixture together until a smooth paste appears, scraping down the sides as needed. Add more water to thin it out if out if needed, 1 tablespoon at a time.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-hummus/#wprm-recipe-53389-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Keto-roasted-cauliflower-hummus-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with your favorite crunchy low-carb side dishes (peppers, cucumber, pork rinds, homemade crackers) and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-hummus/#wprm-recipe-53389-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
